  "evidenceReuse": "Reaffirms the previous seven-unit audit and its source-backed authority failures. Rechecked live headless, React, renderer, error, root and decoration contracts. Current source and installed Pretext 0.0.7 establish font-cache invalidation. Added matched source-derived projection/packing/geometry probes, lifecycle and local-paint guards, a font experiment and proposed-signature type proof. Intermediate unrelated React graph failures were retained in the plan; final current package and combined type reruns passed.",
  "summary": "Plan view-owned pagination: direct PagedEditable inputs and exact-ref usePageLayout; one-shot measurePages for headless consumers; delete page-break persistence and the public live controller. Text fragments carry measured source ranges; units are complete atomic subtrees with real dimensions, keep-together applies to text, and overflow expands occupied canvas geometry. One projection and private surface-local paint replace copied orchestration. Six disposable probes and final type/current-package checks pass; adoption is planned and production/native proof remains partial.",
